%402x.png","line":30,"embedded":true},{"title":"A partial screenshot of the Camera Control overlay displaying a picker control.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/27e6bc8836d9265133dd150098c3865d/camera-control-picker-control%402x.png","line":32,"embedded":true},{"title":"A partial screenshot of the Camera Control overlay displaying the system zoom factor control.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/3bb2ecfcd292742f087c064e5dfd1ec5/system-control-type-zoom-factor%402x.png","line":36,"embedded":true},{"title":"A partial screenshot of the Camera Control overlay displaying the system exposure bias control.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/47568cc559bb20a5cea03ded2199916b/system-control-type-exposure-bias%402x.png","line":38,"embedded":true},{"title":"Best practices","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/camera-control#Best-practices","line":40},{"title":"SF Symbols app","target":"https://developer.apple.com/sf-symbols/","line":42},{"title":"A partial screenshot of the Camera Control overlay displaying a camera flash control that uses the bolt.fill symbol.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/29e9dac71ac35e1d3d9510a545fce3c3/camera-control-picker-sf-symbols-flash%402x.png","line":44,"embedded":true},{"title":"A partial screenshot of the Camera Control overlay displaying a camera filters control that uses the camera.filters symbol.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/17466338143a202a0241d26725f23048/camera-control-picker-sf-symbols-filters%402x.png","line":46,"embedded":true},{"title":"`localizedValueFormat`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVFoundation/AVCaptureSlider/localizedValueFormat","line":50},{"title":"A partial screenshot showing an example of the Camera Control overlay with a slider control displaying a value and context for the type of value.","target":"https://docs-assets.develop